 once you have the ip aliases setup, your NAT rules for the new IP's =
will need to take into account the original destination IP; like so:

  -A PREROUTING -i eth0 -p tcp -d x.x.x.x --dport 443 \
     -j DNAT --to-destination 10.16.6.24:8443

